WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.232
"I'm done!"

2
00:00:06.233 --> 00:00:12.626
It was Wednesday night, and Lily had just finished typing her report on icebergs.

3
00:00:12.627 --> 00:00:15.738
For a moment she was relieved.

4
00:00:15.739 --> 00:00:18.627
But then her heart sank.

5
00:00:18.628 --> 00:00:24.292
On Friday she would have to stand in front of her class and present the report.

6
00:00:24.293 --> 00:00:27.470
She hated speaking in public.

7
00:00:27.471 --> 00:00:30.612
What if she made a fool of herself?

8
00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:34.621
On Thursday Lily was talking with her friends.

9
00:00:34.622 --> 00:00:39.880
"The Green Guys are coming to our school tomorrow," Sandeep said.

10
00:00:39.881 --> 00:00:43.082
The Green Guys were a theater group.

11
00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:49.293
They acted, played music, and performed magic tricks.

12
00:00:49.294 --> 00:00:52.297
"That will be fun," Lily said.

13
00:00:52.298 --> 00:00:55.382
Then her stomach did a flip.

14
00:00:55.383 --> 00:01:01.297
Tomorrow was Friday—she had to present her iceberg report to the class.

15
00:01:01.298 --> 00:01:07.012
"I'll be so nervous that I won't be able to enjoy the Green Guys at all," she thought.

16
00:01:07.013 --> 00:01:10.954
That night Lily practiced reading her report.

17
00:01:10.955 --> 00:01:18.276
She hated the sound of her voice, and at one point, she said "icebug" instead of "iceberg."

18
00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:21.069
She groaned.

19
00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:24.272
"I'm going to make so many mistakes.

20
00:01:24.273 --> 00:01:27.062
Everyone is going to laugh at me."

21
00:01:27.063 --> 00:01:31.595
Lily watched some public speaking tutorials online.

22
00:01:31.596 --> 00:01:38.452
They all said basically the same thing: be prepared, be relaxed, and be confident.

23
00:01:38.453 --> 00:01:42.483
In the morning Lily's stomach was in knots.

24
00:01:42.484 --> 00:01:46.962
"Maybe the school bus will get a flat tire," she thought.

25
00:01:46.963 --> 00:01:59.437
"Then I won't have to go to school."

26
00:01:59.438 --> 00:02:03.714
An hour later Lily was in the school auditorium.

27
00:02:03.715 --> 00:02:11.004
Everyone laughed as the Green Guys did a silly dance.

28
00:02:11.005 --> 00:02:14.977
Even Lily was enjoying the show.

29
00:02:14.978 --> 00:02:18.475
One Green Guy walked into the crowd of students.

30
00:02:18.476 --> 00:02:21.053
He needed a volunteer.

31
00:02:21.054 --> 00:02:24.885
All around Lily, kids raised their hands and shouted.

32
00:02:24.886 --> 00:02:26.682
"I'll volunteer!"

33
00:02:26.683 --> 00:02:28.850
"Pick me!"

34
00:02:28.851 --> 00:02:33.688
Lily sank as low as she could, trying to be invisible.

35
00:02:33.689 --> 00:02:39.424
She gulped when the Green Guy looked directly at her and waved her over.

36
00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:42.570
Lily wanted to escape.

37
00:02:42.571 --> 00:02:45.951
But everyone was staring at her.

38
00:02:45.952 --> 00:02:51.077
Reluctantly she followed the Green Guy up onto the stage.

39
00:02:51.078 --> 00:02:58.646
The Green Guy handed Lily a jar of jelly beans and then ran to the other end of the stage.

40
00:02:58.647 --> 00:03:06.502
He opened his mouth and pointed at it.

41
00:03:06.503 --> 00:03:12.829
Lily threw one of the jelly beans, and the Green Guy caught it in his mouth.

42
00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:18.136
Everyone cheered.

43
00:03:18.137 --> 00:03:23.692
Lily was amazed.

44
00:03:23.693 --> 00:03:32.199
She threw another jelly bean, and the Green Guy caught that one too.

45
00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:37.904
When Lily threw a third jelly bean, however, the Green Guy missed.

46
00:03:37.905 --> 00:03:41.864
"Oops!" Lily thought. "He messed up!"

47
00:03:41.865 --> 00:03:44.668
But the Green Guy didn't seem to care.

48
00:03:44.669 --> 00:03:49.772
He was already waiting for the next jelly bean.

49
00:03:49.773 --> 00:03:54.067
Lily quickly threw it.

50
00:03:54.068 --> 00:04:02.125
The Green Guy caught it, and everyone cheered again.

51
00:04:02.126 --> 00:04:09.415
"He missed one," Lily thought, "and the audience barely noticed."

52
00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:15.764
The jelly beans looked good, so Lily ate one.

53
00:04:15.765 --> 00:04:22.127
The Green Guy put his hands on his hips and pretended to be angry.

54
00:04:22.128 --> 00:04:26.661
Trying not to giggle, Lily pretended to be angry too.

55
00:04:26.662 --> 00:04:33.462
Everyone in the audience laughed.

56
00:04:33.463 --> 00:04:36.813
"This is kind of fun," Lily thought.

57
00:04:36.814 --> 00:04:40.181
Now the Green Guy was staring at her.

58
00:04:40.182 --> 00:04:45.470
He squinted as if he were wondering what Lily would do next.

59
00:04:45.471 --> 00:04:51.322
Lily stared back, grabbed a jelly bean, and ate it.

60
00:04:51.323 --> 00:04:59.470
The audience exploded with laughter as the Green Guy waved his arms around, pretending to be furious.

61
00:04:59.471 --> 00:05:05.647
A moment later Lily and the Green Guy bowed.

62
00:05:05.648 --> 00:05:10.915
As Lily returned to her seat, everyone applauded and cheered for her.

63
00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:17.507
Sandeep clapped her on the back. "You were awesome!"

64
00:05:17.508 --> 00:05:19.727
Lily beamed.

65
00:05:19.728 --> 00:05:24.254
She thought about her presentation on icebergs and realized something:

66
00:05:24.255 --> 00:05:31.067
she wasn't nervous about making a mistake anymore!

